464.description:
Play Publishing has released the second version of the game "Truckers." How does it differ from the first version, and what new features have been included in this truck simulator?

Game features:
- The overseas area is at your service;
- By downloading the Truckers 2 torrent from us, the player gains access to 60 diverse missions, with generous rewards for successful completion;
- The goal of the driver is to deliver the cargo as quickly as possible - but this does not mean that you just need to get from point A to B, along the way you need to master the new road, overtake other drivers following the same route and with the same goal, despite less than favorable weather conditions and law enforcement officers monitoring the observance of order on the roads;
- 5 truck models to choose from, with the ability to change both the appearance and technical content; money for upgrades is earned by completing missions;
- Enhanced driving model, thanks to the Nvidia PhysX Engine;
- Convenient and advanced interface – you can change speed, turn on parking lights or windshield wipers, and virtually all actions of truck drivers while driving are included, all for a complete sense of realism;
- The ability to create your own transport network – simply download the game Truckers 2 via torrent and become a leader in the freight transportation industry;
- How to avoid being spotted by the traffic police and what to do when encountering bandits on the road are just part of the exciting gameplay;
- For those who love the roads, with their romance and beautiful views outside the window, without an excessive set of additional tasks and other things - 320 kilometers of familiar roads, with vigilant servants of the law, punishing in case of violation;
- Fully develop your monopoly – and all you need to do is download the game Truckers 2 – you have access to a variety of vehicles, earn money from missions, you can upgrade your existing truck or even buy a new one, and by acquiring land, you can build a base.

Installation:
1. Install the game
2. Play
